usernames — bundled data notices
================================

Every word list under data/ is built from the sources below by the scripts in script/
(build_reserved_data.rb, build_offensive_data.rb, build_words_data.rb). Each source's full
licence text and copyright line is in data/LICENSES/<name>.txt. Revisions are the HEAD commit
of each upstream repository on the retrieval date, 2026-10-27 (the date the source files were
downloaded); the last commit touching the file used is given too
where it differs. Nothing GPL, AGPL, CC-BY, CC-BY-NC or unlicensed is vendored: words from such
sources (Mastodon, Discourse, Misskey, Debian base-passwd, Microsoft Learn) appear only as short
retyped facts under the `usernames` row.

